226 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Structure isn\031t neutral \024 it\031s a lens that includes some things and filters others\056 In ambiguity\054\240framing too soon can flatten insight\054 but\240framing too late can paralyze motion\056\n\nOn\055demand structure\240honors\240emergent discovery\054 waiting until the user signals a need for scaffolding\056\nStructure\055first\240invites\240early alignment\054 letting frameworks channel thinking even in the absence of full data\056\n\nThis is a tension between\240exploratory fluidity and cognitive anchoring\056\n\nGreat strategists often oscillate between the two\054 knowing when to invite structure\054 and when to defer it\054 and AI should be fluent in both rhythms\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 227 0 R
     /Pg 220 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

